{"id":"fb675485fa8bddd8","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-omega-operator-jump.md","title":"Omega Together with Its Oracle Computes the Jump","display":"thm-omega-operator-jump — Omega Together with Its Oracle Computes the Jump","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-omega-operator-jump","aliases":["43-thm-omega-operator-jump"],"display":"thm-omega-operator-jump — Omega Together with Its Oracle Computes the Jump","depends_on":["[[43-df-omega-operator]]","[[43-df-oracle-prefix-machine]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Proposition 18.2.5","source_printed_pages":"555–556","source_pdf_pages":"575–576","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-omega-operator-jump"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-omega-operator-jump</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-operator-jump — Omega Together with Its Oracle Computes the Jump"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" href=\"?note=19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" title=\"43-df-oracle-prefix-machine\">43-df-oracle-prefix-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Proposition 18.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"555–556"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"575–576"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(U\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" href=\"?note=19dbd8d7e38e55f5\" title=\"43-df-oracle-prefix-machine\">43-df-oracle-prefix-machine</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(A,X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A\">\\(\\Omega_U^A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0680931785133191\" href=\"?note=0680931785133191\" title=\"43-df-omega-operator\">43-df-omega-operator</a> 的实数值，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是下式显式给出的二进制展开；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^\\prime\">\\(A^\\prime\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A,X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\\Rightarrow X\\oplus A\\equiv_T A^\\prime\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A,X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\\Rightarrow X\\oplus A\\equiv_T A^\\prime\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>实数的二进制名称通过断言中的等式绑定，避免将实数直接代入序列交织。通用性保证输出随机且非二进有理，故展开唯一。必须保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus A\">\\(\\oplus A\\)</span>。单独 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_U^A\">\\(\\Omega_U^A\\)</span> 一般并不与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^\\prime\">\\(A^\\prime\\)</span> 同度；知道 oracle 后，Omega 的精度才可控制相对停止域的枚举。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Proposition 18.2.5；印刷页 555–556，PDF 页 575–576。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-omega-operator","status":"resolved","id":"0680931785133191","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-omega-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-prefix-machine","status":"resolved","id":"19dbd8d7e38e55f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-prefix-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79