esis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[43-df-oracle-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$A,X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\Omega_U^A$ 是 [[43-df-omega-operator]] 的实数值，$X$ 是下式显式给出的二进制展开；$A^\\prime$、$\\oplus$、$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[43-df-oracle-prefix-machine]] 的 $\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)$；$A,X\\in2^\\omega$。$\\Omega_U^A$ 是 [[43-df-omega-operator]] 的实数值，$X$ 是下式显式给出的二进制展开；$A^\\prime$、$\\oplus$、$\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalOraclePF}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"A,X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U^A","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A^\\prime","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall A,X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\Omega_U^A=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X(n)2^{-n-1}\\Rightarrow X\\oplus A\\equiv_T A^\\prime\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\oplus A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega_U^A","display":false},{"tex":"A^\\prime","display":false}],"bytes":1844,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-466","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-omega-operator-jump]] — Omega Together with Its Oracle Computes the Jump"}],"outgoing":["0680931785133191","19dbd8d7e38e55f5","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","0784d1de3a88cd94","be1278f108eb178d"]}